units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice bcc 3.165
region box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

mass 1 183.84

replicate 10 1 1

pair_style deepmd ${dp_test}
pair_coeff * *

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1

timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press vol

dump 1 all custom 100 w.lammpstrj id type x y z

run 100
